        {"name": "请把扫把放好", "en": "Put the broom away, please.", "lessonUrl": "put-the-broom-away-please.jpg"},
        {"name": "你可以拿个新的垃圾袋过来吗", "en": "Can you get a new trash bag, please?", "lessonUrl": "can-you-get-a-new-trash-bag-please.jpg"},
        {"name": "把垃圾袋打开套在垃圾桶上", "en": "Open the trash bag and put it in the trash can.", "lessonUrl": "open-the-trash-bag-and-put-it-in-the-trash-can.jpg"}
